{
    "word": "dooddoen",
    "lang_code": "nl",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [],
        "ru-extract.jsonl": [],
        "nl-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "73a35023-2bf5-3153-965b-30398780d7af",
                "word": "dooddoen",
                "pos": "verb",
                "lang_code": "nl",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "51d084fd-b912-304a-8271-c3a6c7b95ee5",
                        "entry_id": "73a35023-2bf5-3153-965b-30398780d7af",
                        "glosses": [
                            "doodmaken, doden, doodslaan, vermoorden"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f728b3b9-1380-44b1-8c2c-55a9805c81ff",
                                "sense_id": "51d084fd-b912-304a-8271-c3a6c7b95ee5",
                                "text": "De burgerlijke partijen stelden zich ook vragen bij de methodes die de beschuldigde gebruikte. ‘Ik ga het nooit gebruiken, maar het inbrengen van lucht is volgens mij een pijnloze, snelle dood. Er zijn nog duizenden middelen, mijn professor zei altijd dat je ook met water iemand kunt dooddoen. Ook dat eerste feit kan ik vanuit mijn onderzoek begrijpen.’"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "be599534-0f15-3bc4-b8a2-4c10df60e221",
                        "entry_id": "73a35023-2bf5-3153-965b-30398780d7af",
                        "glosses": [
                            "verslaan, overwinnen"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "71ce9c17-2d27-4fd0-b2df-537e973e8ba7",
                                "sense_id": "be599534-0f15-3bc4-b8a2-4c10df60e221",
                                "text": "'Dit is niet leuk. Met alle kansen die we hadden, hadden we de match kunnen dooddoen. We speelden een goede match gespeeld, maar wat kopen we daarmee?' De ex-doelman van OHL en Beerschot maakte wel zijn debuut in de Champions League. 'Daar doe je het voor, maar om dan zo drie ballen uit de netten te pakken... Maar we moeten zo verderdoen. We zijn jong, we hebben genoeg kwaliteiten, dat hebben we wel laten zien. Maar toch, ik ga slecht slapen.'"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e0bea11a-c73e-4810-a952-53ce02d9266b",
                                "sense_id": "be599534-0f15-3bc4-b8a2-4c10df60e221",
                                "text": "De match tegen Lokeren bracht beterschap, maar Genk heeft zich nog steeds maar half opgericht. Anders had het een zwak Lokeren in eigen huis wel kunnen dooddoen."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f41fdf2e-6c07-3fbe-aa1f-f44d433354a1",
                        "entry_id": "73a35023-2bf5-3153-965b-30398780d7af",
                        "glosses": [
                            "ontkrachten van een uitspraak of redenering"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "329a1f11-7a00-4c81-98b0-d584f698b6a3",
                        "source_entry_id": "73a35023-2bf5-3153-965b-30398780d7af",
                        "source_sense_id": "51d084fd-b912-304a-8271-c3a6c7b95ee5",
                        "source_sense_description": "doodmaken, doden",
                        "target_lang_word": "kill",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "kill",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "48ff2bac-d4c9-3e4e-9e1f-83aadf697176",
                                        "entry_id": "52a1c40c-557a-3a2c-99f3-d0ad4c7188b1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To put to death; to extinguish the life of."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "279c05db-74cd-4408-b3e9-59ae81fd3ea8",
                                                "sense_id": "48ff2bac-d4c9-3e4e-9e1f-83aadf697176",
                                                "text": "Smoking kills more people each year than alcohol and hard drugs combined."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6d0a15f9-1615-422e-8af4-4e7960915488",
                                                "sense_id": "48ff2bac-d4c9-3e4e-9e1f-83aadf697176",
                                                "text": "A Troope of Horſe with Felt: Ile put't in proofe, / And when I haue ſtolne vpon theſe Son in Lawes, / Then kill, kill, kill, kill, kill, kill."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3db3003a-07ad-433c-b053-bfd9d1024640",
                                                "sense_id": "48ff2bac-d4c9-3e4e-9e1f-83aadf697176",
                                                "text": "Stephano: Monſter, I will kill this man : his daughter and I will be King and Queene, ſave our Graces : and Trinculo and thy ſelfe ſhall be Vice-royes : […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7ba3c512-b06d-43a0-8679-0f2388cd6d9a",
                                                "sense_id": "48ff2bac-d4c9-3e4e-9e1f-83aadf697176",
                                                "text": "Fire ants circumvented the problem of an ineffective sting by having an unusual and highly effective venom that when daubed or sprayed on other ants penetrates their waxy protective integumental barrier and kills or disables them."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "133b68dc-f6e3-412a-9081-aa7fe8296f0a",
                                                "sense_id": "48ff2bac-d4c9-3e4e-9e1f-83aadf697176",
                                                "text": "Indeed, referring to his drone murder extermination campaign Obama bragged: \"I'm really good at killing people!\" Those are Obama's own words!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e7394214-ff0f-41b2-98d1-4856b7d472ff",
                                                "sense_id": "48ff2bac-d4c9-3e4e-9e1f-83aadf697176",
                                                "text": "As the country reckons with how to prevent more children from being killed at school, the legacies of the Parkland victims live on."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "17c72f94-98d3-452a-b680-267ddf4af08c",
                                                "sense_id": "48ff2bac-d4c9-3e4e-9e1f-83aadf697176",
                                                "text": "After all, improving road safety has become a widely endorsed cause because nobody wants to kill, or be killed, in a road accident."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "94d1e429-f4c3-43e9-9963-e7d27a306bc1",
                                                "sense_id": "48ff2bac-d4c9-3e4e-9e1f-83aadf697176",
                                                "text": "In announcing the review, Robert F. Kennedy Jr., the new health secretary, said in a statement that “antisemitism — like racism — is a spiritual and moral malady that sickens societies and kills people with lethalities comparable to history’s most deadly plagues.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f296614a-c9d0-3954-882f-7e15eb52c4cd",
                                        "entry_id": "52a1c40c-557a-3a2c-99f3-d0ad4c7188b1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To render inoperative."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "102dd9e5-b352-4ec9-afa2-3fa17574b279",
                                                "sense_id": "f296614a-c9d0-3954-882f-7e15eb52c4cd",
                                                "text": "He killed the engine and turned off the headlights, but remained in the car, waiting."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "998320ad-bb5b-40e7-94b1-31033cd644a0",
                                                "sense_id": "f296614a-c9d0-3954-882f-7e15eb52c4cd",
                                                "text": "He killed the motor."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "15d5c4cb-6eeb-4343-9478-b465d9d8dd1b",
                                                "sense_id": "f296614a-c9d0-3954-882f-7e15eb52c4cd",
                                                "text": "Peter: Ask Childers if it was worth his arm.\nPoliceman: What did you do to his arm, Peter?\nPeter: I killed it, with a machine gun."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0b3da13e-07e7-348a-a80a-6df3b5286521",
                                        "entry_id": "52a1c40c-557a-3a2c-99f3-d0ad4c7188b1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To stop, cease, or render void; to terminate."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4d51bd03-7a65-4d98-a031-3743e757cb2e",
                                                "sense_id": "0b3da13e-07e7-348a-a80a-6df3b5286521",
                                                "text": "The editor decided to kill the story."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1d1f604e-359e-4409-a987-dd8c90b54996",
                                                "sense_id": "0b3da13e-07e7-348a-a80a-6df3b5286521",
                                                "text": "The news that a hurricane had destroyed our beach house killed our plans to sell it."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "95fa10ba-a84f-4890-aaa7-3bc9ebaeeffb",
                                                "sense_id": "0b3da13e-07e7-348a-a80a-6df3b5286521",
                                                "text": "My computer wouldn't respond until I killed some of the running processes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b0249a0b-c741-4a48-b0e3-2d4b90fc104b",
                                                "sense_id": "0b3da13e-07e7-348a-a80a-6df3b5286521",
                                                "text": "He closed the boot, walked round to the kerbside and bent to peer into the car's interior, his face pressed to the passenger window, his hands shading his eyes to kill the reflection."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d4a97a14-b9b7-3df7-9a84-741d62e8b890",
                                        "entry_id": "52a1c40c-557a-3a2c-99f3-d0ad4c7188b1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To amaze, exceed, stun, or otherwise incapacitate."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "excessive",
                                            "figuratively",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0033e309-92bc-471b-a248-133cc15afe69",
                                                "sense_id": "d4a97a14-b9b7-3df7-9a84-741d62e8b890",
                                                "text": "That night, she was dressed to kill."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0be25e62-077a-4867-8338-ada84147eecb",
                                                "sense_id": "d4a97a14-b9b7-3df7-9a84-741d62e8b890",
                                                "text": "That joke always kills me."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ebb318e1-6232-41b7-bdeb-51628cc6bc5f",
                                                "sense_id": "d4a97a14-b9b7-3df7-9a84-741d62e8b890",
                                                "text": "He told us we ought to think of Jesus as our buddy and all. He said he talked to Jesus all the time. Even when he was driving his car. That killed me."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a2db2b5b-e4b4-39b5-a0fd-e5c20d245792",
                                        "entry_id": "52a1c40c-557a-3a2c-99f3-d0ad4c7188b1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To cause great pain, discomfort, or distress to; to hurt."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "excessive",
                                            "figuratively",
                                            "intransitive",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "42c3a16f-e5c7-442e-a44b-92115bf36ff7",
                                                "sense_id": "a2db2b5b-e4b4-39b5-a0fd-e5c20d245792",
                                                "text": "These tight shoes are killing my feet."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "742bb2a6-14fc-4da9-a22c-191b20a47aea",
                                                "sense_id": "a2db2b5b-e4b4-39b5-a0fd-e5c20d245792",
                                                "text": "You don't ever want to get rabies. The doctor will have to give you multiple shots and they really kill."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "76247e54-140c-478c-8a67-4ada76cdc484",
                                                "sense_id": "a2db2b5b-e4b4-39b5-a0fd-e5c20d245792",
                                                "text": "two laps into our first walk, my dad needed to sit down. His back and legs were killing him. \"You'll be okay,\" I assured him. \"You just need to shake off the rust.\"\nI gave him a couple of Advil and, after a few minutes, urged him back onto the track."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "379e2c31-7a68-3074-8060-1d6c8ea16e1c",
                                        "entry_id": "52a1c40c-557a-3a2c-99f3-d0ad4c7188b1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To produce feelings of dissatisfaction or revulsion in."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c553daa7-d29d-4cb4-bb75-6be6fc129f92",
                                                "sense_id": "379e2c31-7a68-3074-8060-1d6c8ea16e1c",
                                                "text": "It kills me to throw out three whole turkeys, but I can't get anyone to take them and they've already started to go bad."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cb97b51e-0fd9-4b0f-9bda-aed2925a4310",
                                                "sense_id": "379e2c31-7a68-3074-8060-1d6c8ea16e1c",
                                                "text": "It kills me to learn how many poor people are practically starving in this country while rich moguls spend such outrageous amounts on useless luxuries."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0832dc20-cef4-4058-a3b7-c19f988b2d58",
                                                "sense_id": "379e2c31-7a68-3074-8060-1d6c8ea16e1c",
                                                "text": "And I really don't think you get it now\nNo, I really don't think you get it now\nIt's killing me, I admit it now\nCongratulations, you tore my heart out\nCongratulations"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2b74f1a3-838c-3cda-a4e7-3f880046d5fb",
                                        "entry_id": "52a1c40c-557a-3a2c-99f3-d0ad4c7188b1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To use up or to waste."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4bd88948-ffaa-4512-888e-b7ddb7b9a1a6",
                                                "sense_id": "2b74f1a3-838c-3cda-a4e7-3f880046d5fb",
                                                "text": "I'm just doing this to kill time."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5975b1d0-c405-4d05-8766-d0ec6c10c42c",
                                                "sense_id": "2b74f1a3-838c-3cda-a4e7-3f880046d5fb",
                                                "text": "Except for the shirt, which he’d worn, and the check, which he’d cashed, and the bottle of port, which he’d killed in bed on Christmas night, the gifts from his family were still on the floor of his bedroom."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d8cc5de0-872e-3095-a19b-ee3a2427801f",
                                        "entry_id": "52a1c40c-557a-3a2c-99f3-d0ad4c7188b1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To overpower, overwhelm, or defeat."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively",
                                            "informal",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0bd7ed15-c8c5-44f9-a955-87ffd72d4172",
                                                "sense_id": "d8cc5de0-872e-3095-a19b-ee3a2427801f",
                                                "text": "Look at the amount of destruction to the enemy base. We pretty much killed their ability to retaliate."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f0035378-b1a3-4f8b-95aa-25576278eeba",
                                                "sense_id": "d8cc5de0-872e-3095-a19b-ee3a2427801f",
                                                "text": "The team had absolutely killed their traditional rivals, and the local sports bars were raucous with celebrations."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d3545d9b-a874-310f-9916-82ac763aafa4",
                                        "entry_id": "52a1c40c-557a-3a2c-99f3-d0ad4c7188b1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To force a company out of business."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b789d0dc-0857-330b-9198-370821c002ec",
                                        "entry_id": "52a1c40c-557a-3a2c-99f3-d0ad4c7188b1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To punish severely."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "excessive",
                                            "figuratively",
                                            "informal",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a7fe1386-9c3d-4e65-b2ea-5ff355a385b3",
                                                "sense_id": "b789d0dc-0857-330b-9198-370821c002ec",
                                                "text": "My parents are going to kill me!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3e766f69-a7c3-4eaa-b4d4-1209c3909414",
                                                "sense_id": "b789d0dc-0857-330b-9198-370821c002ec",
                                                "text": "\"Father will kill us for this.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6e65bef5-2f63-39e5-8e11-03365c0d8076",
                                        "entry_id": "52a1c40c-557a-3a2c-99f3-d0ad4c7188b1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To strike (a ball, etc.) with such force and placement as to make a shot that is impossible to defend against, usually winning a point."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c999b2b2-ec63-4773-b67c-bb57ea445c47",
                                                "sense_id": "6e65bef5-2f63-39e5-8e11-03365c0d8076",
                                                "text": "That close call encouraged Wales to launch another series of attacks that ended when lock Louis Deacon killed the ball illegally in the shadow of England's posts."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "269db735-0726-39e4-bd99-e591b4615e03",
                                        "entry_id": "52a1c40c-557a-3a2c-99f3-d0ad4c7188b1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To cause (a ball, etc.) to be out of play, resulting in a stoppage of gameplay."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a93acd81-44dd-4d9a-ad68-238948ec37c7",
                                                "sense_id": "269db735-0726-39e4-bd99-e591b4615e03",
                                                "text": "As the ball was delivered deep into St Kilda's forward line by Billings, Bontempelli had position on the goal line, with a pack forming in front of him. He decided to fly but didn't kill the ball, leaving it to spill where he had been positioned moments earlier. Jack Sinclair gratefully swooped and kicked a goal that cut the margin to five points."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b82dfb44-6dc3-3178-a5c4-29a46c135a01",
                                        "entry_id": "52a1c40c-557a-3a2c-99f3-d0ad4c7188b1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To succeed with an audience, especially in comedy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c741feaf-61b9-4110-8eb0-2ec5064b9348",
                                                "sense_id": "b82dfb44-6dc3-3178-a5c4-29a46c135a01",
                                                "text": "When comics fail, they \"die\"; when they succeed, they \"kill.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0071d0bf-82d6-4040-be96-9e6171342614",
                                                "sense_id": "b82dfb44-6dc3-3178-a5c4-29a46c135a01",
                                                "text": "You really killed it at the Comedy Store last night."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "09d6bd85-3f04-3d24-af4d-50513ae40bf7",
                                        "entry_id": "52a1c40c-557a-3a2c-99f3-d0ad4c7188b1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To cause to assume the value zero."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7fb78b61-9507-30f5-a85e-b5382d62a7ec",
                                        "entry_id": "52a1c40c-557a-3a2c-99f3-d0ad4c7188b1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To disconnect (a user) involuntarily from the network."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Internet",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "02ac756a-fd1f-3ad7-a938-41120e925c99",
                                        "entry_id": "52a1c40c-557a-3a2c-99f3-d0ad4c7188b1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To deadmelt."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "571b3bec-b3b1-3032-baf4-d3896c007c5c",
                                        "entry_id": "52a1c40c-557a-3a2c-99f3-d0ad4c7188b1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To sexually penetrate in a skillful way."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1b5aa659-7fca-48f4-9c3f-31bb668d7a0d",
                                                "sense_id": "571b3bec-b3b1-3032-baf4-d3896c007c5c",
                                                "text": "I felt on her big fat fanny\nPulled out the jammy and killed the punanni"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "76ce7bc0-68e2-3dce-9a8e-80fa596714cd",
                                        "entry_id": "52a1c40c-557a-3a2c-99f3-d0ad4c7188b1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To exert oneself to an excessive degree."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal",
                                            "reflexive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "048d8c56-ba03-4ed9-aac5-4f183514ce76",
                                                "sense_id": "76ce7bc0-68e2-3dce-9a8e-80fa596714cd",
                                                "text": "Don't kill yourself raking the leaves now; we're due for a windstorm tonight."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "kill",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d546e715-4c03-3aa1-9ec8-49d4f2c40b79",
                                        "entry_id": "29f8684e-b8b2-32d4-8afc-6f933d656958",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The act of killing."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9c96e9d6-bc17-4579-a08f-dad4c858b445",
                                                "sense_id": "d546e715-4c03-3aa1-9ec8-49d4f2c40b79",
                                                "text": "The assassin liked to make a clean kill, and thus favored small arms over explosives."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "439d1f5e-ed60-4d50-93a5-9309cf941e7f",
                                                "sense_id": "d546e715-4c03-3aa1-9ec8-49d4f2c40b79",
                                                "text": "The blonde women were in a frenzy of excitement, their faces transformed from dull moronity to living evil; they shouted like wild animals at the kill."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a71adb79-0f02-37d1-86fb-3fdd26ac45cb",
                                        "entry_id": "29f8684e-b8b2-32d4-8afc-6f933d656958",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Specifically, the death blow."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7f3ebccb-7de7-4092-a6dd-a15bccfcc953",
                                                "sense_id": "a71adb79-0f02-37d1-86fb-3fdd26ac45cb",
                                                "text": "The hunter delivered the kill with a pistol shot to the head."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "acffdcaf-5022-3a14-ae41-b720d6a61674",
                                        "entry_id": "29f8684e-b8b2-32d4-8afc-6f933d656958",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The result of killing; that which has been killed."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b6c52a03-aa96-46e6-99eb-29fdd2e8d638",
                                                "sense_id": "acffdcaf-5022-3a14-ae41-b720d6a61674",
                                                "text": "The fox dragged its kill back to its den."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1082c3ad-6c4f-4b4b-bf23-dd068e6811de",
                                                "sense_id": "acffdcaf-5022-3a14-ae41-b720d6a61674",
                                                "text": "If ye plunder his kill from a weaker, devour not all in thy pride."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ca8ca077-175a-3783-9e87-6c025149fa31",
                                        "entry_id": "29f8684e-b8b2-32d4-8afc-6f933d656958",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An instance of killing; a score on the tally of enemy personnel or vehicles killed or destroyed."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8ccbb605-8426-4c58-b91d-6532f4eb2062",
                                                "sense_id": "ca8ca077-175a-3783-9e87-6c025149fa31",
                                                "text": "confirmed kills"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "26c5311a-dfe1-48cd-8d7e-51dd82d0014f",
                                                "sense_id": "ca8ca077-175a-3783-9e87-6c025149fa31",
                                                "text": "A flying ace is usually one with five or more confirmed kills."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "adfc58a5-9a95-3faa-a874-46b53bd8ed52",
                                        "entry_id": "29f8684e-b8b2-32d4-8afc-6f933d656958",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The grounding of the ball on the opponent's court, winning the rally."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bb33a2ae-4f49-45c9-b285-e0d47365ebbc",
                                                "sense_id": "adfc58a5-9a95-3faa-a874-46b53bd8ed52",
                                                "text": "As a senior in 1993, Turner had a kill percentage of 40.8, which was a school record at the time and the best in the SAC. Turner concluded her volleyball career with 1,349 kills, ranking fifth all-time at Catawba."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "kill",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "619003fb-f1b8-3112-b912-b5734481f6ce",
                                        "entry_id": "bdd2e364-8830-3249-a7b5-fe6f52ff8295",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A creek; a body of water; a channel or arm of the sea."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "New-York"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "afbe72d3-c0da-42f8-9c9a-e0c0c49b9864",
                                                "sense_id": "619003fb-f1b8-3112-b912-b5734481f6ce",
                                                "text": "The channel beyond Staten Island, which connects Newark Bay with Bergen Neck is the Kill van Kull, or the Kills."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "80432af9-471f-43ce-adda-b8ce1ec868ac",
                                                "sense_id": "619003fb-f1b8-3112-b912-b5734481f6ce",
                                                "text": "Schuylkill, Catskill, etc."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "kill",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "67165219-52a5-3f0b-9379-b2593d066c91",
                                        "entry_id": "e21bac89-9514-350a-ab3d-93cb1298e98d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Alternative form of kiln."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "alternative",
                                            "rare"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "57f767db-8e8c-4f0f-9eb1-786f79224549",
                                                "sense_id": "67165219-52a5-3f0b-9379-b2593d066c91",
                                                "text": "This very curious and valuable record is as follows, in the handwriting of Conyers and the accompanying engraving is carefully reduced (see Fig. 138 ) from Conyers' own drawing:—“This kill was full of the coarser sorts of potts or cullings, so that few were saved whole, viz., lamps, bottles, urnes, dishes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fd2c8dc4-62ed-445b-a312-f64dd5a3d867",
                                                "sense_id": "67165219-52a5-3f0b-9379-b2593d066c91",
                                                "text": "The stack of one of the pottery kills is still a visible land mark of this once thriving industry."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "85f69ef6-ed8f-48e8-b0d0-231ea020a501",
                                                "sense_id": "67165219-52a5-3f0b-9379-b2593d066c91",
                                                "text": "A funerary ceremony comparable to that reported from Kolomoki site is indicated, though no \"pottery kill” was located."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "61837fe3-6cc8-41f2-b8f7-32324bd8b26c",
                                                "sense_id": "67165219-52a5-3f0b-9379-b2593d066c91",
                                                "text": "We may indeed assume that cracked and broken ware was discarded in the immediate vicinity of the pottery kills, that is, if it was not thrown in to the Krka."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8c233485-e573-4042-886e-768afb9205ac",
                                                "sense_id": "67165219-52a5-3f0b-9379-b2593d066c91",
                                                "text": "Admonished that she should “keep the woman's virtue and be more silent,” she countered “that she was 'born in a mill, begot in a kill, she must have her will,' she could speak no softlier.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
